# Piata's tower before the Governor's debrief. Its door record has
# building 1 and $3E, which loc_6EA6 (ps2.asm:10231) never treats as a
# building: with $C712 clear the push is simply refused (moveq #-1, d4).
# Found by the door sweep: the port used to enter Rolf's house here,
# asking for window $3B+$3E = $79, which the ROM does not have.

start level 9 9 25           # a new game: $C712 clear
wait screen level
wait idle
walk up 1
wait step
shot 01_at_the_door
press up                     # into the door
wait ticks 60
wait idle
expect screen level
expect level 9 9 24
shot 02_still_shut
expect no-stderr not ported
